      "Station Hub is a full-stack travel and booking platform connecting passengers with nearby travel stations. The passenger mobile app (React Native + Expo) covers JWT-based auth, location-based station discovery, station browsing with amenities and services, seat booking with from/to, date, time and seat count, onboarding/splash flow, profile management, and custom location selection. A separate React 19 + Vite admin dashboard (with Framer Motion and full dark/light theme support) lets operators view stats, manage stations, and manage bookings through protected routes. The backend is a modular FastAPI service with routers for auth, stations, bookings, services, profile, settings, and dashboard, using the Firebase Admin SDK for data storage and auth verification, JWT (python-jose) middleware, and bcrypt/passlib password hashing.",
